{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103190","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110319001:1":{"text":"今日はここまでにしよう。この戦い、お前たちの勝ちだ。","source_cn":"今天就到这里吧。这场战斗，是你们赢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x233F9B660B2DE332","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110319002:1":{"text":"本当に……勝ったのか？……オレとアルサで、戦神ブルータスに勝った……？","source_cn":"我们……真的赢了？……我和阿尔萨，赢了战神布鲁特斯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CF15853A89C1493","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110319003:1":{"text":"うそ……てっきりさっきので死んだと思ったよ！","source_cn":"真的吗？刚才那下子，还以为我们要完蛋了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9583B03E60AF4557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110319004:1":{"text":"お前たちの勝ちだ。ふっ、実に愉快な戦いだったぞ。","source_cn":"是你们的胜利。啊，真是场有趣的战斗——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50DE75108D922A6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1110319004":{"text":"お前たちの勝ちだ。ふっ、実に愉快な戦いだったぞ。","source_cn":"是你们的胜利。啊，真是场有趣的战斗——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50DE75108D922A6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"